   "text": "{\"sections\":[{\"section\":\"summary\",\"body\":\"Tarnavi AI met all three financial covenants on the Venture Term Loan for the period ended October 31, 2026, and the compliance certificate agrees with the bank's calculation on each. The most notable development is a decline in the cushion on the Minimum Unrestricted Cash covenant since August, which triggered one low-severity early warning signal. Cash of {{fact:66afaff8-c6b3-497d-8c96-12123d42bb7e}} remains above the {{fact:db22c1c9-42fa-48d7-8a1a-e9311c37eca8}} minimum. No work items are open, and nothing on the sheet currently awaits a decision.\"},{\"section\":\"covenants\",\"body\":\"Minimum Runway was calculated at {{fact:edfb1bf2-f14f-4a59-b341-701363e0214e}} against a required {{fact:54cfea7c-1972-452a-81bd-983cca2213a9}}, a cushion of {{fact:ec479692-e663-4157-bb10-e62227f7d0d5}}. The certificate reports {{fact:35979a63-a189-4d99-a43d-87310bae8e4a}}. Minimum Unrestricted Cash was calculated at {{fact:66afaff8-c6b3-497d-8c96-12123d42bb7e}} against {{fact:db22c1c9-42fa-48d7-8a1a-e9311c37eca8}}, a cushion of {{fact:a15673c9-b1b7-48e6-8435-3d5b72f181a1}}. The certificate reports {{fact:bf4f16e7-1f2e-40a0-9276-a4ff63b883e8}}. Revenue to Plan was calculated at {{fact:d35c1fb8-d577-4d76-bd51-2c56f2dfd541}} against {{fact:ec6bc828-3268-43b8-9a49-9dad5e41ee75}}, a cushion of {{fact:9fd357f5-0f0a-4f88-b20e-ef8f5cfd2901}}. The certificate reports {{fact:cac14d83-0a5b-4624-a15a-827ff42736b1}}. All three are compliant, and the reported figures match the bank's calculations.\"},{\"section\":\"risks\",\"body\":\"One signal fired: covenant headroom falling, rated low severity. The cushion on Minimum Unrestricted Cash now stands at {{fact:a15673c9-b1b7-48e6-8435-3d5b72f181a1}}. The signal reports a steady decline from August, which is consistent with ongoing cash burn. The August cushion figure was not among the facts provided, so a reviewer may wish to confirm the trend against the prior calculation runs. A reviewer may also wish to read it alongside the runway result. No other signal fired, and there are no open work items awaiting review.\"}]}",
